y movements. Rhinos' doctrine is to hold."},{"seq":763,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c256","house":"rhino","letter":"L342","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-1","path":["rhino-camp","n-west"],"depart":5700,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":764,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c257","house":"rhino","letter":"L343","kind":"order","to":"rhino-arch-1","path":["rhino-camp","n-west","F1"],"depart":6000,"plain":"BOWMEN, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":"OKWIAJ, DKHS MT WART BKQS."},{"seq":765,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c258","house":"rhino","letter":"L344","kind":"order","to":"rhino-ele-1","path":["rhino-camp"],"depart":5700,"plain":"ELEPHANTS, MARCH TO NORTH BANK WEST.","cipher":null},{"seq":766,"t":5700,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"groq:qwen/qwen3.8-27b","tokens":1824,"retries":0},{"seq":767,"t":5700,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"Holding F2 (inf/arch) and F3 (ele). Tiger is massing at F3 (cav/arch seen 2w ago) but order is 2w old. Rhino is pushing F1 (8w ago). My cavalry is fresh at camp. Hold strongpoints to maintain 2/3 fords. No need to risk riders; fog is high."},{"seq":768,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c259","house":"kite","letter":"L345","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid","F2"],"depart":6000,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT NORTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":"BEQRS BKKS, DKHO TS JKQSD ATJG IEOOHN."},{"seq":769,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c260","house":"kite","letter":"L346","kind":"order","to":"kite-arch-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid","F2"],"depart":6000,"plain":"BOWMEN, HOLD AT NORTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":"AKWINJ, DKHO TS JKQSD ATJG IEOOHN."},{"seq":770,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c261","house":"kite","letter":"L347","kind":"order","to":"kite-ele-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east"],"depart":6000,"plain":"ELEPHANTS, HOLD AT NORTH BANK EAST.","cipher":"NHNMDTJSR, DKHO TS JKQSD ATJG NTRS."},{"seq":771,"t":5700,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"nim:nvidia/nem